# apt packages for Linux agent boxes (Ubuntu 24.04+).
# Minimal by design: fresh boxes get only hard dependencies of the tracked
# home/ config and the asdf runtime. Everything else is appended here when a
# real need shows up — this file is the "add as we go" list.
# Applied by: dot apply linux-agent (scripts/linux-agent.sh)
# Drift-check: `apt-mark showmanual` should converge toward this list.

# Fresh-box bootstrap: git clone + gh auth login (runbook step 1)
git
gh

# Required by dot apply home — stow.sh preflight
stow

# Required by home/.gitconfig — filter.lfs.required = true, git hard-fails without it
git-lfs

# Required by asdf-nodejs runtime builds (gcc, g++, make; python3 is stock)
build-essential

# --- Add when a need actually arises (uncomment, then dot apply linux-agent) ---
# zsh/starship — only if agent boxes should run the tracked .zshrc as login
# shell. Note: .zshrc references /opt/homebrew asdf paths that need a Linux
# guard first.
# zsh
# starship
